{"id":"n70592-1-9","stage":5,"title":"유언비어 · 流言蜚语","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70592-1-9-1","ko":"너 그 연예인에 대한 소문 들었니? 정말 깜짝 놀랐어.","zh":"你听说关于那个艺人的传闻了吗？我真的吓了一跳。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연예인에","meaning":"艺人","explanation":"연예인：艺人；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"연예인","audio":"/audio/c21f2e832c0791d63474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14021","senseId":"1","lemma":"연예인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소문","meaning":"传闻，传言","explanation":"소문：传闻，传言","readings":[{"term":"소문","audio":"/audio/69d345cbab4729f2caec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83167","senseId":"1","lemma":"소문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었니?","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깜짝","meaning":"一惊","explanation":"깜짝：一惊","readings":[{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37744","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀랐어.","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"c21f2e832c0791d6","term":"연예인","zh":"艺人","audio":"/audio/c21f2e832c0791d63474.mp3","entryId":"14021","definition":"把演技、唱歌或跳舞等演艺活动作为职业的人。","pronunciation":["여ː녜인"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"69d345cbab4729f2","term":"소문","zh":"传闻，传言","audio":"/audio/69d345cbab4729f2caec.mp3","entryId":"83167","definition":"在众人之间广泛传播的话语或消息。","pronunciation":["소ː문"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b47d1db3113dea64","term":"깜짝","zh":"一惊","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3","entryId":"37744","definition":"突然间受惊的样子。","pronunciation":["깜짝"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/663ba18d71aa6281aa44.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70592-1-9-2","ko":"그런 유언비어는 믿을 게 못 돼.","zh":"那种流言根本不可信。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유언비어는","meaning":"流言蜚语","explanation":"유언비어：流言蜚语；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유언비어","audio":"/audio/63daf7accb4f9c4fb048.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70592","senseId":"1","lemma":"유언비어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"믿을","meaning":"信，相信","explanation":"믿다：信，相信；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69478","senseId":"1","lemma":"믿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","explanation":"못：没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"3","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"63daf7accb4f9c4f","term":"유언비어","zh":"流言蜚语","audio":"/audio/63daf7accb4f9c4fb048.mp3","entryId":"70592","definition":"没有确定的根据而流传开来的消息。","pronunciation":["유언비어"]},{"id":"03fdf42bef953df4","term":"믿다","zh":"信，相信","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3","entryId":"69478","definition":"认为正确或是事实。","pronunciation":["믿따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6c18ce7af88ec9ecc82.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70592","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你听说关于那个艺人的传闻了吗？我真的吓了一跳。","那种流言根本不可信。","外面的天气这么凉爽，真是太好了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你听说关于那个艺人的传闻了吗？我真的吓了一跳。","那种流言根本不可信。","外面的天气这么凉爽，真是太好了。"],"answer":1}]}
